WEBVTT

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:33.292
Freedom, freedom, freedom, oy!

00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:35.294
Freedom, freedom, freedom, oy!

00:00:35.377 --> 00:00:38.213
There's no denying it, the future's crazy.

00:00:38.297 --> 00:00:39.965
Oh, well, don't want to stand out.

00:00:40.048 --> 00:00:42.050
Freedom, freedom, freedom, oy!

00:00:42.134 --> 00:00:43.886
Freedom, freedom, freedom, oy!

00:00:43.969 --> 00:00:45.762
There's nothing crazy about it.

00:00:45.846 --> 00:00:47.931
It's just Freedom Day.

00:00:55.439 --> 00:00:56.773
So, what is Freedom Day?

00:00:56.857 --> 00:00:59.401
Sounds like some kind
of feminine hygiene product.

00:00:59.484 --> 00:01:02.613
No. It's a fabulous, crabulous day!

00:01:02.738 --> 00:01:04.656
If you want to do something, you do it,

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.241
and to spleck with the consequences!

00:01:07.492 --> 00:01:09.578
You know, like how I live every day.

00:01:14.124 --> 00:01:15.542
Happy Freedom Day!

00:01:15.626 --> 00:01:17.878
Oh, I think my wrist is broken.

00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:20.255
Of course, it wouldn't be Freedom Day

00:01:20.339 --> 00:01:22.132
without the traditional freedom tub.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:26.386
- Ooh.
- Wow, baby.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:29.598
Mm, that'll feel nice
on my shattered bones.

00:01:33.477 --> 00:01:35.229
Wow, nude hot-tubbing?

00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:37.773
That's all I need to hear
about Freedom Day.

00:01:37.856 --> 00:01:40.817
Then consider
the following lecture a bonus.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.694
On Earth, freedom is a given.

00:01:42.778 --> 00:01:45.530
But on my planet,
we have to suffer for it.

00:01:46.949 --> 00:01:50.452
Sure, you can be a comedian
instead of a doctor,

00:01:50.535 --> 00:01:53.872
if you want your parents
to roll over in their graves!

00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:58.377
Sure, you can vote for Shknadel,

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:01.004
if you want there should be a recession!

00:02:02.714 --> 00:02:05.217
Sure, you can go to medical school,

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.886
if you've given up
on your dream of being a comedian!

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:13.575
That's why I love Earth.
You can do what you want

00:02:13.659 --> 00:02:16.870
and no one makes you feel guilty
because no one cares.

00:02:16.953 --> 00:02:18.497
We're not listening!

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.791
That's what I'm talking about.

00:02:43.021 --> 00:02:44.731
Freedom, freedom, freedom, oy!

00:02:44.815 --> 00:02:46.608
Freedom, freedom, freedom, oy!

00:02:52.698 --> 00:02:54.157
Excuse me, coming through!

00:02:54.241 --> 00:02:55.909
Freedom Train arriving on track one.

00:02:57.536 --> 00:03:00.205
- Ow, you broke my foot!
- Freedom!

00:03:00.288 --> 00:03:02.249
What's this next float, Linda?

00:03:02.332 --> 00:03:05.877
Representing our men, women
and children in uniform,

00:03:05.961 --> 00:03:09.381
it's Earth's greatest space hero,
Zapp Brannigan.

00:03:09.464 --> 00:03:11.550
Happy Freedom Day, ladies.

00:03:11.633 --> 00:03:14.177
Come on, let loose and show me something.

00:03:14.261 --> 00:03:17.055
Anything. Seriously, I'd take an armpit.

00:03:18.306 --> 00:03:20.642
Oh, yeah. Thank you, Linda.

00:03:22.102 --> 00:03:23.270
You're welcome!

00:03:23.353 --> 00:03:25.355
Okay, Morbo, now it's your turn.

00:03:25.439 --> 00:03:28.191
If that is your Freedom Day wish...

00:03:41.121 --> 00:03:43.874
Thank you, Secretary of Transportation.

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:45.459
My fellow Earthicans...

00:03:45.542 --> 00:03:48.962
We enjoy so much freedom,
it's almost sickening.

00:03:49.046 --> 00:03:53.216
We're free to choose which hand
our sex-monitoring chip is implanted in.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.385
And if we don't want to pay our taxes

00:03:55.469 --> 00:03:59.139
why, we're free to spend a weekend
with the Pain Monster.

00:03:59.222 --> 00:04:01.350
See you April 15, folks!

00:04:01.433 --> 00:04:03.769
Cue the fireworks guy.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.436
- Ooh...
- Ah...

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:15.314
Incidentally, tonight's
Freedom Day celebration

00:04:15.397 --> 00:04:16.940
is brought to you by

00:04:17.691 --> 00:04:19.860
Shankman's Rubbing Compound.

00:04:19.943 --> 00:04:22.613
When something needs rubbing,
think Shankman.

00:04:22.696 --> 00:04:24.698
Yeah, Shankman!

00:04:24.781 --> 00:04:26.742
It costs a little more, but it's worth it.

00:04:26.867 --> 00:04:30.203
Our planet has been through
so much this past year,

00:04:30.287 --> 00:04:32.748
wars, droughts, impeachments,

00:04:32.831 --> 00:04:37.002
but we've never lost our sense
of what's truly important,

00:04:37.085 --> 00:04:39.588
the great taste of Charleston Chew.

00:04:42.341 --> 00:04:44.092
And now, let us salute

00:04:44.176 --> 00:04:47.721
that beloved symbol of freedom, our flag,

00:04:47.804 --> 00:04:49.681
Ol' Freebie.

00:04:55.145 --> 00:04:57.898
I'm swelling with patriotic mucus.

00:04:59.524 --> 00:05:00.776
In our darkest hour,

00:05:00.859 --> 00:05:04.613
we can stand erect
with proud, upthrust bosoms...

00:05:04.696 --> 00:05:06.365
Anyone who laughs is a Communist.

00:05:06.448 --> 00:05:09.409
...knowing that,
with a shifty glance skyward,

00:05:09.493 --> 00:05:12.663
we will see by the rocket's red glare

00:05:12.746 --> 00:05:15.999
that our flag is still there.

00:05:16.083 --> 00:05:17.501
It's gone!

00:05:23.507 --> 00:05:26.385
Yes, fellow patriots, I ate your flag!

00:05:26.468 --> 00:05:28.387
And I did it with pride.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.098
For to express oneself by doing a thing

00:05:31.181 --> 00:05:33.892
is the very essence of Freedom Day.

00:05:33.976 --> 00:05:37.729
Bless this planet
and all its wonderful people.

00:05:40.357 --> 00:05:41.525
Kill him!

00:05:41.608 --> 00:05:43.235
Kill the traitor!

00:05:56.748 --> 00:05:59.334
Hey, it's the guy who desecrated our flag!

00:05:59.418 --> 00:06:01.670
Stop that Red menace!

00:06:16.101 --> 00:06:17.686
Oh, I'm all scuttled out.

00:06:17.769 --> 00:06:18.770
What?

00:06:18.854 --> 00:06:21.064
My planet's embassy?

00:06:21.148 --> 00:06:22.816
They're paid to not kill me.

00:06:32.175 --> 00:06:34.344
I thought I understood this world.

00:06:34.428 --> 00:06:36.430
I thought I was fitting in.

00:06:36.513 --> 00:06:39.057
But I guess I don't belong here
any more than I do

00:06:39.141 --> 00:06:40.559
on our crappy home planet.

00:06:40.642 --> 00:06:41.643
Ooh, sorry.

00:06:41.727 --> 00:06:44.604
What, sorry? Our planet stinks.
We all know it.

00:06:44.688 --> 00:06:47.190
Enough with the persecution, I'm saying.

00:06:47.274 --> 00:06:50.527
Zoidberg, as Ambassador,
I promise you the full support

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.237
of our government already.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:55.907
Poor boy. You want maybe a nice mug cocoa?

00:06:58.118 --> 00:07:01.872
Ambassador Moivin,
you and your staff are so kind.

00:07:01.955 --> 00:07:03.707
I am truly humbled.

00:07:04.875 --> 00:07:06.501
What, no marshmallows?

00:07:08.253 --> 00:07:10.130
Let's storm the place!

00:07:10.213 --> 00:07:11.631
Without my prior knowledge.

00:07:11.757 --> 00:07:14.134
Coming through,
Freedom Train, step aside.

00:07:14.217 --> 00:07:15.719
You, too, Fatso, freedom!

00:07:15.802 --> 00:07:17.220
Cool your jowls, Nixon.

00:07:17.304 --> 00:07:20.474
You may not like it that
Dr. Zoidberg desecrated a flag.

00:07:20.557 --> 00:07:23.435
You may even find the image
of it festering in his bowels

00:07:23.518 --> 00:07:24.770
somehow offensive,

00:07:24.853 --> 00:07:26.897
but the right to freedom of expression

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.149
is guaranteed by the Earth Constitution.

00:07:29.232 --> 00:07:31.568
Maybe so.

00:07:31.651 --> 00:07:34.696
But I know a place where
the Constitution doesn't mean squat.

00:07:36.782 --> 00:07:41.244
The Supreme Court hereby accepts
the case of Earth v. Zoidberg.

00:07:41.328 --> 00:07:42.371
Sock it to 'em!

00:07:47.292 --> 00:07:51.380
Two, four, six, eight,
eating the flag is bad.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.300
Now, your noose knot
has exactly seven twists.

00:07:55.384 --> 00:07:56.718
You can eat my dog

00:07:56.802 --> 00:07:58.136
You can eat my truck

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.931
But you eat my flag
and you're out of luck

00:08:01.014 --> 00:08:03.850
She's a-waving proud around the world

00:08:03.934 --> 00:08:06.353
From Dallas to Fort Worth

00:08:06.436 --> 00:08:07.813
Let me say it again...

00:08:09.106 --> 00:08:10.273
Don't mess with Earth!

00:08:10.357 --> 00:08:11.942
They sure hate Dr. Zoidberg.

00:08:12.025 --> 00:08:15.487
Posers. I was hating Zoidberg
before it was cool.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:18.380
Where are we ever going to find
a lawyer to take his case?

00:08:18.405 --> 00:08:20.200
I'll ask the head of the ACLU,

00:08:20.283 --> 00:08:21.451
once he's done singing.

00:08:21.535 --> 00:08:25.372
Don't mess with Earth

00:08:25.455 --> 00:08:27.582
Kill Zoidberg! Good night!

00:08:27.666 --> 00:08:28.712
Howdy there.

00:08:29.067 --> 00:08:32.237
I'm a lawyer, and I'd like
to help your friend out of this pickle.

00:08:32.321 --> 00:08:33.363
Who are you, old man?

00:08:33.447 --> 00:08:35.032
Name's Old Man Waterfall,

00:08:35.115 --> 00:08:37.784
but most folks just call me "Old Man."

00:08:37.868 --> 00:08:39.286
I'll never remember that.

00:08:39.369 --> 00:08:41.288
I'm a veteran of three dozen wars.

00:08:41.371 --> 00:08:43.123
Name a body part and a planet

00:08:43.206 --> 00:08:45.375
and I've taken a bullet in it, on it,

00:08:45.459 --> 00:08:48.378
all to keep our flag flyin' free.

00:08:48.462 --> 00:08:51.298
And you want to defend Zoidberg?

00:08:51.381 --> 00:08:53.592
Are you familiar
with the old robot saying...

00:08:53.675 --> 00:08:55.260
"Does not compute"?

00:08:55.344 --> 00:08:57.846
Son, to me, a robot's just a garbage can

00:08:57.929 --> 00:08:59.264
with sparks coming out of it.

00:08:59.348 --> 00:09:01.183
The sparks keep me warm.

00:09:01.266 --> 00:09:03.560
I don't condone what Dr. Zoidberg did

00:09:03.644 --> 00:09:06.813
but I'll fight tooth and nail
for his freedom to do it.

00:09:06.897 --> 00:09:09.566
Or, I would, if I hadn't lost
my teeth and nails

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.652
on Mars and Saturn, respectively.

00:09:11.735 --> 00:09:14.696
Wait, you're a lawyer? You're hired!

00:09:20.327 --> 00:09:22.329
You okay there in the Embassy, Zoidberg?

00:09:22.412 --> 00:09:24.998
No. There's no cocoa marshmallows.

00:09:25.082 --> 00:09:28.418
And every night, the rats eat
a little more of my foot.

00:09:28.502 --> 00:09:29.795
Oyez, oyez, oyez.

00:09:29.878 --> 00:09:32.297
All rise for the Honorable Chief
Justice Myrtle Fu

00:09:32.381 --> 00:09:33.757
and the Associate Justices.

00:09:45.385 --> 00:09:47.471
Counsel, you may address
the court on behalf of Earth

00:09:47.554 --> 00:09:48.555
if you're ready.

00:09:48.639 --> 00:09:50.599
I was hatched ready.

00:09:51.099 --> 00:09:56.146
Honorable Judgeheads,
yonder crawdad done et up our flag.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:10:00.025
I was doing freedom of speech.
Earth's most sacred right.

00:10:00.108 --> 00:10:04.363
Your Honor, freedom of speech
applies to what comes out of a mouth,

00:10:04.446 --> 00:10:05.906
not what goes in.

00:10:05.989 --> 00:10:07.407
Can Counsel cite precedent?

00:10:07.491 --> 00:10:08.951
Uh, yes, darlin', I can.

00:10:09.034 --> 00:10:12.663
In State of Alabama
vs. Giant Space Iguana,

00:10:12.746 --> 00:10:16.750
chewing the corners off the Constitution
was deemed nonprotected speech.

00:10:16.833 --> 00:10:18.752
He shut you up, O'Connor.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.129
Mr. Waterfall,

00:10:21.213 --> 00:10:24.174
you may now present arguments
on behalf of Dr. Zoidberg.

00:10:24.258 --> 00:10:26.009
Oh, God, I'm nervous.

00:10:26.093 --> 00:10:28.220
Two of my three hearts are having attacks.

00:10:29.388 --> 00:10:31.765
Court's kind of fun
when it's not my ass on the line.

00:10:31.848 --> 00:10:32.849
Nachos?

00:10:33.267 --> 00:10:35.143
Oh, Land O' Goshen.

00:10:35.769 --> 00:10:38.814
Your Honors, I'm not
some slick, big-city lawyer

00:10:38.897 --> 00:10:40.274
like my opponent here...

00:10:41.525 --> 00:10:44.403
...but I am a veteran
who has fought for his planet.

00:10:44.486 --> 00:10:45.612
You see this hand of mine?

00:10:45.696 --> 00:10:46.697
Yes, I do.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:49.741
No, you don't, 'cause I lost my real hand

00:10:49.825 --> 00:10:52.536
planting the flag
when we took back Halley's Comet.

00:10:52.619 --> 00:10:56.331
Yet it was worth it,
so much do I love that flag.

00:10:56.707 --> 00:10:58.709
Aw...

00:10:58.792 --> 00:11:01.795
I love it even more
than I love my seven wives.

00:11:01.878 --> 00:11:03.589
That's right, I'm a polygamist.

00:11:05.465 --> 00:11:08.760
Yet I would gladly eat a flag myself,

00:11:08.844 --> 00:11:11.013
had I not used my intestine as a rope

00:11:11.096 --> 00:11:13.432
to hoist a flag made of my own skin,

00:11:13.515 --> 00:11:16.935
if it would protect the freedoms
of the proud people

00:11:17.019 --> 00:11:18.353
who salute that flag.

00:11:20.522 --> 00:11:22.232
Freedoms such as polygamy.

00:11:23.984 --> 00:11:25.611
I rest my case.

00:11:27.029 --> 00:11:28.071
Whoa, geez.

00:11:28.155 --> 00:11:32.826
The Justices and I will now confer
using high-speed telepathy.

00:11:50.928 --> 00:11:54.598
By a vote of six to three,
we find that flag-eating

00:11:54.681 --> 00:11:57.267
is not protected by the Constitution.

00:11:59.061 --> 00:12:01.521
Six to three? I beat the spread.

00:12:01.605 --> 00:12:04.775
The court orders
an immediate public apology.

00:12:04.858 --> 00:12:06.235
Apology accepted.

00:12:06.318 --> 00:12:08.111
Just don't let it happen again.

00:12:08.195 --> 00:12:10.280
She means you, you turkey of the sea.

00:12:10.364 --> 00:12:13.033
Me, apologize? Never!

00:12:13.116 --> 00:12:16.536
I came to this planet to learn
the meaning of freedom!

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:19.456
But I say it's you
who should get a nice lesson!

00:12:19.539 --> 00:12:22.584
So, do your worst, because
no punishment could be bigger

00:12:22.668 --> 00:12:24.419
than denying me my freedom!

00:12:24.503 --> 00:12:27.130
You are hereby sentenced to death.

00:12:27.673 --> 00:12:29.132
Wait, let me finish!

00:12:30.842 --> 00:12:34.096
Also, in a rare double-whammy decision,

00:12:34.179 --> 00:12:36.515
the court finds polygamy constitutional.

00:12:38.433 --> 00:12:40.435
I can't wait to tell my husband.

00:12:43.814 --> 00:12:47.192
Remember, men, take him alive,
so there's something left to kill.

00:12:50.862 --> 00:12:51.989
Stay back!

00:12:52.072 --> 00:12:55.951
This Embassy is sovereign mud
of the mud planet Decapod 10.

00:12:56.034 --> 00:12:59.288
Invading these mud premises
is an act of war!

00:12:59.371 --> 00:13:02.416
Yeah? Well, what are you going
to do about it, shrimpy?

00:13:02.499 --> 00:13:04.918
You want to see, Mr. Bigshot?

00:13:05.794 --> 00:13:07.212
Attack Earth!

00:13:08.046 --> 00:13:10.257
Yes, I know it's a shlep, just do it!

00:13:21.143 --> 00:13:24.521
A-ha! Now the rubber band's
on the other claw!

00:13:28.233 --> 00:13:30.110
Ready? Retreat!

00:13:53.759 --> 00:13:55.135
Shh!

00:13:59.348 --> 00:14:01.183
Deny my freedom, will you?

00:14:01.266 --> 00:14:02.643
Well, we'll do to you

00:14:02.726 --> 00:14:05.270
what we did to the Squash Men
of the Squash Planet,

00:14:05.354 --> 00:14:06.438
squish them!

00:14:07.773 --> 00:14:09.608
- Charleston Chew?
- You bet.

00:14:17.241 --> 00:14:19.409
All right, Kif, let's show these freaks

00:14:19.493 --> 00:14:22.704
what a bloated, runaway
military budget can do.

00:14:23.121 --> 00:14:25.916
Bring me the activation codes
for our global defense network.

00:14:25.999 --> 00:14:27.417
Aye, aye, sir.

00:14:34.466 --> 00:14:37.553
Commence lip identification scan.

00:14:39.596 --> 00:14:40.806
No tongue.

00:14:44.017 --> 00:14:46.228
Mm...

00:14:46.311 --> 00:14:48.355
We can't be too careful with these codes.

00:14:48.438 --> 00:14:51.942
Rumor has it, a double agent
may be aboard this very ship.

00:14:52.901 --> 00:14:54.444
I'm watching you.

00:14:54.778 --> 00:14:56.196
You, Ensign, what's your name?

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.614
Hugh Mann, sir.

00:14:57.698 --> 00:14:58.991
Hugh Mann.

00:14:59.074 --> 00:15:00.826
Now, that's a name I can trust.

00:15:00.909 --> 00:15:02.703
Run down to the central battle computer

00:15:02.786 --> 00:15:04.454
and enter these codes, chop-chop.

00:15:07.165 --> 00:15:09.918
Um, sir, there's something
about that Ensign...

00:15:10.002 --> 00:15:11.253
You're damn right there is.

00:15:11.336 --> 00:15:13.964
That strapping young lad's
gunning for your job,

00:15:14.339 --> 00:15:16.508
and he just might get it.

00:15:21.471 --> 00:15:22.723
The enemy approacheth.

00:15:22.806 --> 00:15:26.184
Lieutenant, fire missile one
and recommend me for another medal.

00:15:26.268 --> 00:15:28.186
Make it gaudy, I'm going clubbing later.

00:15:31.231 --> 00:15:32.357
Tick-tock.

00:15:32.441 --> 00:15:35.193
Sir, all planetary defenses
have been disabled.

00:15:35.277 --> 00:15:38.405
Perhaps the Decapodians
acquired our secret codes.

00:15:38.488 --> 00:15:39.489
Somehow.

00:15:39.573 --> 00:15:41.950
Well, Kif, stand by to take the blame.

00:15:42.492 --> 00:15:44.244
Steady... Steady...

00:15:45.078 --> 00:15:46.079
Now!

00:16:04.348 --> 00:16:05.432
Dr. Zoidberg,

00:16:05.515 --> 00:16:08.936
how can you claim to love freedom
and then enslave all of Earth?

00:16:09.019 --> 00:16:11.271
Bah! Your planet doesn't deserve freedom

00:16:11.355 --> 00:16:13.690
until it learns what it is
to not have freedom.

00:16:13.774 --> 00:16:15.192
It's a lesson, I say.

00:16:16.109 --> 00:16:17.194
Ow!

00:16:17.277 --> 00:16:19.821
What the hell is this dirt pile
we're building, anyhow?

00:16:19.905 --> 00:16:21.573
None of your beeswax, slave.

00:16:21.657 --> 00:16:23.158
You'll find out soon enough.

00:16:23.242 --> 00:16:25.327
Just focus on globbing that mud.

00:16:26.119 --> 00:16:27.162
Glob!

00:16:35.254 --> 00:16:36.755
I'm not good at being a slave.

00:16:36.838 --> 00:16:38.465
I'm thinking about graduate school.

00:16:38.548 --> 00:16:39.967
You know, to become a barber.

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:41.176
This can't go on.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:43.387
Today is the day we fight back!

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:45.472
It's already 10:00.

00:16:45.556 --> 00:16:46.932
Oh, you're right.

00:16:47.015 --> 00:16:48.850
Tomorrow is the day we fight back.

00:16:48.934 --> 00:16:50.936
Yeah? Well, good luck, sister.

00:16:51.019 --> 00:16:53.230
All our modern technology is useless.

00:16:53.313 --> 00:16:54.523
I know I am.

00:16:58.679 --> 00:17:01.139
Hey, wait. I'm having one of those things.

00:17:01.263 --> 00:17:03.348
You know, a headache with pictures.

00:17:03.432 --> 00:17:04.433
An idea?

00:17:10.647 --> 00:17:11.773
Back in my day,

00:17:11.857 --> 00:17:14.276
we didn't have your fancy
all-digital weapons,

00:17:14.359 --> 00:17:16.903
but we still managed
to kill each other just fine.

00:17:16.987 --> 00:17:18.947
Ah, the crossbow.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.199
A pitiless, elegant killing machine.

00:17:21.283 --> 00:17:23.118
The Bender of the 15th century.

00:17:23.201 --> 00:17:24.411
Not big enough.

00:17:24.494 --> 00:17:26.663
We need something that can
take out an entire army.

00:17:26.747 --> 00:17:28.331
Something you could commit
a war crime with...

00:17:32.753 --> 00:17:33.962
Ow.

00:17:37.332 --> 00:17:41.461
Earth's slaves,
behold the fruit of your labors...

00:17:41.545 --> 00:17:43.296
The Mobile Oppression Palace!

00:17:46.133 --> 00:17:47.259
Neat.

00:17:47.592 --> 00:17:51.388
I don't need to tell you
that occupation forces are expensive.

00:17:51.471 --> 00:17:53.724
But with the Mobile Oppression Palace,

00:17:53.807 --> 00:17:56.852
a few dignitaries can
oppress your entire planet

00:17:56.935 --> 00:17:58.395
for pennies a day.

00:18:00.647 --> 00:18:02.441
Warships dismissed!

00:18:28.717 --> 00:18:31.595
Do your worst you sea devils!

00:18:31.678 --> 00:18:34.264
I'll make my stand with Ol' Freebie!

00:18:34.348 --> 00:18:37.893
You can crush me,
but you can't crush my spirit!

00:18:39.061 --> 00:18:40.562
Ah! My spirit!

00:18:43.398 --> 00:18:45.567
Great-Grandpa, no!

00:18:46.401 --> 00:18:49.738
Another victim of
the manocentric male-ocracy.

00:18:49.821 --> 00:18:52.574
Ambassador Moivin, you killed my lawyer.

00:18:52.658 --> 00:18:53.784
You're welcome.

00:18:53.867 --> 00:18:56.244
He defended my freedom
when no one else would.

00:18:56.328 --> 00:18:58.288
He was a good and honorable man.

00:18:58.372 --> 00:19:01.750
I request a satanic funeral.

00:19:04.169 --> 00:19:07.130
Is it possible that all this
slavery and oppression

00:19:07.155 --> 00:19:08.962
is shmutzing up our freedom lesson?

00:19:08.987 --> 00:19:10.780
Oh, take a pill, Zoidberg.

00:19:11.051 --> 00:19:13.428
Begin again with the crushing!

00:19:21.103 --> 00:19:23.146
You haven't won yet, Moivin.

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:25.565
You didn't expect us
to even go to a museum,

00:19:25.649 --> 00:19:28.485
much less steal this ancient
heat-seeking missile.

00:19:28.568 --> 00:19:30.153
I don't even know you.

00:19:38.829 --> 00:19:41.164
Oh, it's going to make such a mess.

00:19:49.506 --> 00:19:51.216
This is your secret plan?

00:19:51.299 --> 00:19:52.342
Meh!

00:19:52.426 --> 00:19:56.304
Heat-seeking missiles are useless
against the Mobile Oppression Palace.

00:19:56.388 --> 00:19:59.808
All Decapodian technology
is cold-blooded, like us.

00:20:06.064 --> 00:20:08.108
All eyes on Zoidberg!

00:20:09.276 --> 00:20:10.277
Ew!

00:20:13.947 --> 00:20:15.615
Hey, I need that to smoke!

00:20:18.869 --> 00:20:20.620
Zoidberg, how could you?

00:20:20.704 --> 00:20:22.497
I used to think you were cool.

00:20:22.581 --> 00:20:24.791
Wait, people of Earth, listen.

00:20:24.875 --> 00:20:26.793
Yes, I'm desecrating a flag,

00:20:26.877 --> 00:20:30.172
but to preserve the freedom it represents.

00:20:43.894 --> 00:20:44.895
Blech!

00:20:50.609 --> 00:20:52.944
Zoidberg, you set us free!

00:20:53.028 --> 00:20:55.322
I feel like I could stand to hug you.

00:20:55.405 --> 00:20:58.325
I can't, but you know
what I'm trying to say.

00:20:58.408 --> 00:21:01.244
Zoidberg! Zoidberg! Zoidberg!

00:21:01.328 --> 00:21:04.790
Ah, if only they appreciated
freedom this much

00:21:04.873 --> 00:21:06.375
on my home planet.

00:21:06.792 --> 00:21:08.752
Wait a second, they do!

00:21:09.044 --> 00:21:12.172
Because this is my home planet.

00:21:14.049 --> 00:21:16.968
And now, to raise
this beautiful new flag,

00:21:17.052 --> 00:21:20.180
a red lobster that won't ruin your dinner,

00:21:20.263 --> 00:21:22.557
Dr. John Zoidberg!

00:21:25.811 --> 00:21:27.604
You're a nice man, Nixon.

00:21:29.356 --> 00:21:32.859
Dr. Zoidberg, how's about you take a bite
of the flag for tomorrow's papers?

00:21:32.943 --> 00:21:34.236
Oh, I couldn't.

00:21:34.319 --> 00:21:35.696
No, no, go ahead.

00:21:35.779 --> 00:21:36.822
You've earned it.

00:21:37.155 --> 00:21:39.324
Well, maybe just a taste.

00:21:40.659 --> 00:21:42.202
Mm...

00:21:42.285 --> 00:21:44.788
Now, that's a grand old flag!

00:21:48.375 --> 00:21:51.878
I wonder what
the Shroud of Turin tastes like.

00:22:29.249 --> 00:22:30.250
Freedom.